19 · Inatosha Kuwa Mwema?
Je, siwezi tu kuishi maisha mema bila kumwamini Yesu?

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Je, siwezi tu kuishi maisha mema bila kumwamini Yesu?

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:11,600
Fikiria uko ndani ya meli ya maharamia.

5
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:18,600
Hata ukiisafisha sitaha vizuri kiasi gani, ukiwa mkarimu kwa wafanyakazi, na ukiishi maisha ya mfano —

6
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:23,200
bado wewe ni maharamia,

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,800
kwa sababu meli inakubeba pamoja nayo hadi inapoelekea (bandari ya hukumu).

8
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,000
Tatizo si “alama ya matendo yako” bali “ni meli gani uliyo wake” (utambulisho wako).

